Package: JsonCSVMaskr
Title: Deterministic Masking for JSON and CSV Data
Version: 1.3.0
Authors@R: person("Eric", "Hedberg", email = "hedbergec@outlook.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Eric Hedberg [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Eric Hedberg <hedbergec@outlook.com>
Description: Masks selected fields in CSV and JSON files using deterministic
    HMAC-SHA256 values, exports masking keys, normalizes JSON to CSV tables,
    and provides a Shiny GUI similar to the original PowerShell Data Masking Tool.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Imports:
